sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Peripheral<br>[implements GapPeripheral]

    Note over Product, CN: Pairing is allowed by default.<br>SetAllowPairing has no response callback.

    alt Disable pairing (reject new pairings)
        Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.SetAllowPairing(false)
        Note over Product, CN: New pairings blocked. Bonded centrals can still connect and re-encrypt.
    else Re-enable pairing (default)
        Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.SetAllowPairing(true)
        Note over Product, CN: Redundant if never changed. Restores the default after a previous SetAllowPairing(false).
    end
